# ClaudePane

A Claude Code session in tmux, rendered through a PTY and pyte (prior art:
cass-vessel tui-frontend/widgets/daedalus/). Sessions survive TUI restarts
and can be attached from a plain terminal.

@attached
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Claude · tmux daedalus-main                           ● working │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ > diagram NeedsYou's internals                                  │
│                                                                 │
│ ● Reading docs/design/tui/shell.oph                             │
│ ● Writing docs/design/tui/needs-kohl.oph                        │
│                                                                 │
│                                                                 │
│                                                                 │
│                                                                 │
│                                                                 │
│ > _                                                             │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
note: border is $accent when focused, $panel when not; the strip shows idle/working.

