## ◆SendToClaude

@modal
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Send to Claude                                         │
├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                        │
│ From: PR #38 feat/tui-shell                            │
│                                                        │
│ Review PR #38 (feat/tui-shell) against edict           │
│ 0012's acceptance criteria. Report gaps; don't         │
│ fix them.                                              │
│                                                        │
├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ e edit · enter paste into prompt · esc cancel          │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
note: pastes into Claude's input but never submits; you press enter in the pane.
